msgid "Load external subtitles, pick tracks, adjust style and sync"
msgstr "载入外部字幕、选择轨道、调整样式与同步"

#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"Pick and switch subtitle tracks, load SRT, ASS/SSA, WebVTT, SAMI and MicroDVD subtitles (the encoding is detected), show a secondary subtitle; adjust size, position, font, colour, outline, shadow and background box, and the sync; jump by dialogue; reload external subtitle files automatically when they change.\n"
"Find it in the right-click menu under Subtitles."
msgstr ""
"选择和切换字幕轨，载入 SRT、ASS/SSA、WebVTT、SAMI、MicroDVD 字幕（自动识别编码），显示次字幕；调整字号、位置、字体、颜色、描边、阴影与背景框，调整同步；按对白跳转；外部字幕文件改动后自动重载。\n"
"入口在右键菜单「字幕」。"

